answers.workaround:
(with reference to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d0dc3896ad6fe039e4ad0607d901c81197cb3a3b/modules/gdscript/tests/scripts/runtime/features/object_iterators.gd#L1)

```gdscript
var iterator := MyIterator.new(3)
var store := [null]
if !iterator._iter_init(store):
    return
var next := iterator._iter_get(store[0])
if !iterator._iter_next(store):
    return
next = iterator._iter_get(store[0])
```
